  "releaseNotes": "## Breaking changes\n\n- ** removed** — the static list of experiment IDs is gone. Pass IDs explicitly to  or use  from the new source generator. Pass an empty set to load all experiments.\n\n## New packages\n\n- **** — Roslyn source generator that reads  from  and emits a  class with  and a typed  constant per experiment. Eliminates magic strings at compile time.\n\n  \n  \n\n- **** — generic  backed by a named . Supply a mapper from your response type to ; all HTTP concerns (base address, auth, retry) are configured separately via the standard  pattern.\n\n  \n\n## New features\n\n- **** — in-process test double for controlling flag state in tests without mocking . Fluent  /  API, same pattern as LaunchDarkly  and Unleash .\n\n- **** — background service that polls the registered  on a  schedule. Resolves  from DI; inject  in tests for deterministic time control with no .\n\n  \n\n- **Auto-discovery** —  now loads all experiments when an empty set is passed. Small projects no longer need to enumerate IDs anywhere.\n\n## CI\n\n- Coveralls integration (replaced )\n- Coverage scoped to  source assemblies only via",
